+# AGCP Product Completion Roadmap
+
+## Phase 16 — Foundation and release integrity
+
+- Clean tracked repair artifacts and stale backups
+- Normalize README, version and environment examples
+- Track `.env.production.example`
+- Add Composer and npm lockfiles
+- Make CI reproducible and branch-correct
+- Add release-integrity validation
+
+## Phase 17 — Customer experience completion
+
+- Account profile and password-change screens
+- Dedicated email-verification result and resend flow
+- Terms, privacy, refund and acceptable-use pages
+- Product-detail and order-detail experiences
+- Responsive, permission-aware navigation
+- Consistent loading, empty, validation and error states
+- Remove internal phase labels from customer-facing copy
+
+## Phase 18 — Commerce operations completion
+
+- Customer address book
+- Shipping and billing addresses on carts/orders/invoices
+- Delivery methods, shipping charges and shipment tracking
+- Coupon and promotion management
+- Return and refund request workflow
+- Inventory movement history and stock adjustment audit
+
+## Phase 19 — Integration completion
+
+- At least one certified live payment adapter
+- At least one real supplier adapter
+- Production SMTP provider
+- Optional SMS and push providers
+- Automated DNS/domain verification and SSL state synchronization
+- Provider health, credential rotation and integration runbooks
+
+## Phase 20 — Quality, compliance and launch gate
+
+- Frontend unit and Playwright E2E tests
+- Accessibility checks
+- Backend static analysis and code coverage
+- OpenAPI documentation
+- Dependency and container vulnerability checks
+- Data retention, privacy export/deletion and legal review
+- Production rehearsal, rollback rehearsal and final launch approval
